 kit changes - lists the open changes, their reviews and checks, and the changes merged last

   one of
   *kit changes*  lists the open changes, their reviews and checks, and the changes merged last

     --text   --json   --jq
                           prints the stages as text, even on a terminal

   --stages     prints the stages, one per line, in order, the same over any workspace
   --marks      prints a mark per stage, as one JSON object, which changes when what the stage draws
                does: for each, the forge's own marks of its issues, which move with its changes,
                and of its runs
   reviews      each open change's reviewers: those it asks, and those who reviewed it, by login
   checks       each open change's checks: the latest run of each on its head commit
   merged       the changes merged last, 50 at most, merged last first
   changes      every open change, as kit flow changes prints it; on a terminal it opens in kittui


 kit changes
